      "quote": "(6) The goods and/or services must, as far as practicable, be specified in terms appearing in any listing of goods and services that is: (a) published by the Registrar; and (b) made available for inspection by the public at the Trade Marks Office and its suboffices (if any). (7) If any of the goods and/or services cannot be specified using terms referred to in subregulation (6), the applicant must provide sufficient information to enable the Registrar to decide the classification of the goods and/or services."
